      "XPH12 hammer driver-drill listed at about 4 lbs with battery",
      "XDT13 impact driver rated for 1,500 in-lbs",
      "Hammer mode for masonry anchors"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "XPH12 is rated for 530 in-lbs, modest next to the Milwaukee",
      "Makita's 18V range is smaller than Milwaukee's or DeWalt's in US big-box stores"
